 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 552875,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p>You are a database architect for a company that develops different types of applications, including an ecommerce platform, a real-time analytics tool, and a computer-aided design system. Your job is to choose the right database management system for each application. You have these options:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>relational database management system (RDBMS)</li>\n<li>object-oriented database management system (OODBMS)</li>\n<li>NoSQL database</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Based on this scenario, answer the following questions:</p>\n<ol style=\"list-style-type:lower-alpha\">\n<li>Which DBMS should be chosen for the e-commerce platform and why?</li>\n<li>Which database management system would be most appropriate for the real-time analytics tool and why?</li>\n<li>Which database management system should be selected for the computer-aided design system and why?</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [],
